"Otherwise you're
going to lose, baby."

1089
01:16:31.400 --> 01:16:35.359
"Learn the love's ABCD"

1090
01:16:35.471 --> 01:16:37.496
"You take 100 out of 100"

1091
01:16:37.573 --> 01:16:39.871
"Just pucker your lips and whistle"

1092
