"Come shake a leg with me"

1097
01:16:53.522 --> 01:16:56.150
"Steal my heart and keep it,
sweetheart"

1098
01:16:56.225 --> 01:16:57.783
"Be careful"

1099
01:16:57.860 --> 01:16:59.885
"My heart's fallen for you"

1100
01:16:59.995 --> 01:17:01.963
"You can't lay a hand on me"

1101
01:17:02.031 --> 01:17:04.192
"I am just going to be yours"

1102
