"I don't want to be crazy like you"

1103
01:17:08.470 --> 01:17:10.904
"I desire to do something"

1104
01:17:10.973 --> 01:17:13.066
"To take a step closer"

1105
01:17:13.142 --> 01:17:15.508
"Come closer pucker your lips and..."

1106
01:17:15.611 --> 01:17:17.545
"Whistle with me"

1107
01:17:24.553 --> 01:17:26.612
"Whistle with me"

1108
01:17:33.429 --> 01:17:35.659
"Whistle with me"

1109
01:17:51.180 --> 01:17:53.239
"Whistle with me"

1110
01:18:16.472 --> 01:18:18.630
Oh my, God We're in Delhi

1111
01:18:18.841 --> 01:18:20.604
But what's the position?

1112
01:18:20.809 --> 01:18:22.640
Make your will,
it's time to die.

1113
01:18:23.545 --> 01:18:25.513
I didn't understand one thing

1114
01:18:25.981 --> 01:18:28.779
You revealed their secret

1115
01:18:29.218 --> 01:18:31.049
So now they will be caught.

1116
01:18:32.454 --> 01:18:34.684
They'll be caught
if they were in Delhi.

1117
01:18:36.625 --> 01:18:37.819
I lied.

1118
01:18:38.127 --> 01:18:39.651
You're such a scoundrel.

1119
01:18:39.828 --> 01:18:43.559
Friends who aren't scoundrels,
aren't actually friends.

1120
01:18:45.200 --> 01:18:47.031
They boarded the bus to Shimla

1121
01:19:02.985 --> 01:19:05.579
Sir, these are the details received from
the other police stations of Delhi.

1122
01:19:07.089 --> 01:19:09.421
Will you not speak? Come on, tell me.

1123
01:19:09.491 --> 01:19:11.618
Inspector, this will not do

1124
01:19:12.661 --> 01:19:13.992
Stop it

1125
01:19:15.898 --> 01:19:18.432
Hello, Chaudhary sir
Any information?

1126
01:19:18.867 --> 01:19:21.700
We've rounded up every local goons,
gangsters...

1127
01:19:21.804 --> 01:19:23.135
...pimps... drug-peddlers...

1128
01:19:23.205 --> 01:19:24.832
...from every nook
and corner of Delhi

1129
01:19:25.908 --> 01:19:27.637
But we didn't get a clue yet.

1130
01:19:28.477 --> 01:19:30.206
- But we're trying...
- Trying...

1131
01:19:30.312 --> 01:19:31.540
Get lost!

1132
01:19:39.922 --> 01:19:40.946
I am sorry

1133
01:19:41.924 --> 01:19:42.856
Sorry

1134
01:19:43.425 --> 01:19:47.225
Just... find out my daughter
as soon as you can

1135
01:19:48.130 --> 01:19:49.859
Otherwise I won't
be sorry next time.

1136
01:19:50.999 --> 01:19:53.828
Please I am really scared

1137
01:19:54.470 --> 01:19:57.098
Bablu, can't we run away?

1138
01:19:57.940 --> 01:20:01.666
Here very good

1139
01:20:02.277 --> 01:20:03.676
We won't run anymore

1140
01:20:03.846 --> 01:20:07.976
We'll make these Jats run
from one end to another

1141
01:20:09.918 --> 01:20:11.112
How much are you going to eat?

1142
01:20:11.186 --> 01:20:12.175
This is the first one

1143
01:20:12.254 --> 01:20:14.119
The first one's just
like the last one

1144
01:20:14.189 --> 01:20:17.382
Green chutney Forget
the green chutney...

1145
01:20:17.493 --> 01:20:20.562
...or else they'll
get married Hey...

1146
01:20:21.763 --> 01:20:22.991
Get to the point

1147
01:20:23.365 --> 01:20:26.232
As far as I know Rakesh

1148
01:20:27.503 --> 01:20:29.698
He'll first go to a temple
to get married.

1149
01:20:29.905 --> 01:20:30.997
What did you say?

1150
01:20:34.209 --> 01:20:35.369
Let's go to the temple

1151
01:20:40.916 --> 01:20:43.976
Community wedding!
I want to get married too

1152
01:20:44.052 --> 01:20:45.485
Do you have a heart?

1153
01:20:45.621 --> 01:20:47.418
"I want to get married"

1154
01:20:48.023 --> 01:20:49.251
God...

1155
01:20:50.559 --> 01:20:52.254
Get my Renu back

1156
01:20:54.062 --> 01:20:56.394
Don't show me the day when
I get to know...

1157
01:20:57.299 --> 01:20:59.859
...that Renu eloped willingly.

1158
01:21:01.069 --> 01:21:02.832
I beg of you

1159
01:21:05.974 --> 01:21:07.066
Renu...

1160
01:21:16.952 --> 01:21:17.941
What are you doing?

1161
01:21:18.020 --> 01:21:19.248
Are you crazy?

1162
01:21:19.821 --> 01:21:21.550
I haven't thought about it yet

1163
01:21:22.624 --> 01:21:24.148
But I guess I'll go crazy now.

1164
01:21:26.662 --> 01:21:28.220
Do you know why
I brought you here?

1165
01:21:29.831 --> 01:21:31.492
Because no one lies here.

1166
01:21:32.401 --> 01:21:33.663
Honestly...

1167
01:21:35.237 --> 01:21:36.704
...I like you

1168
01:21:38.207 --> 01:21:39.606
And if you try,

1169
01:21:40.175 --> 01:21:41.574
then I guarantee...

1170
01:21:41.977 --> 01:21:43.171
...you'll start liking me too.

1171
01:21:43.245 --> 01:21:44.769
Attitude again

1172
01:21:45.347 --> 01:21:46.712
What to do?

1173
01:21:47.049 --> 01:21:48.346
Everyone doesn't use it.

1174
01:21:49.384 --> 01:21:50.476
I can't lose it.

1175
01:21:52.120 --> 01:21:53.587
Let go of my hand

1176
01:21:54.389 --> 01:21:55.378
Okay

1177
01:21:57.192 --> 01:21:58.022
What's going on?

1178
01:21:58.093 --> 01:22:00.288
Don't look at Shiv-Parvatiji

1179
01:22:00.696 --> 01:22:01.856
Look at Hanumanji.

1180
01:22:01.964 --> 01:22:04.330
Wait, I'll tell Chaudhary sir.

1181
01:22:04.399 --> 01:22:05.491
- No!
- Tenne. Come here.

1182
01:22:11.707 --> 01:22:12.867
Why are you beating him?

1183
01:22:12.975 --> 01:22:14.499
He's getting fits.

1184
01:22:14.576 --> 01:22:16.669
Then make him smell
leather boots.

1185
01:22:16.745 --> 01:22:17.939
- Do you have one?
- I do. I do.

1186
01:22:18.013 --> 01:22:21.011
Then do it No!

1187
01:22:25.420 --> 01:22:26.512
Check properly

1188
01:22:26.788 --> 01:22:27.880
See her face

1189
01:22:37.933 --> 01:22:39.867
Please find someone else

1190
01:22:40.135 --> 01:22:41.329
I won't find one like you

1191
01:22:41.403 --> 01:22:42.199
Of course you will

1192
01:22:42.271 --> 01:22:43.761
There are so many
girls in this world

1193
01:22:43.872 --> 01:22:44.896
At least try.

1194
01:22:45.374 --> 01:22:46.636
That's what I am doing?

1195
01:22:48.010 --> 01:22:49.170
But I can't find one

1196
01:22:51.246 --> 01:22:52.508
I am not handsome.

1197
01:22:56.184 --> 01:22:57.515
You are...

1198
01:22:59.154 --> 01:22:59.984
Really?

1199
01:23:00.055 --> 01:23:02.455
Yes. You're very handsome.

1200
01:23:02.658 --> 01:23:06.519
Really... Look... you
have a good height

1201
01:23:06.728 --> 01:23:07.922
What are you saying?

1202
01:23:08.163 --> 01:23:09.960
Proper face-cut

1203
01:23:11.033 --> 01:23:12.295
Anything else

1204
01:23:12.601 --> 01:23:14.865
You have a good nose too.
What else do you want?

1205
01:23:16.038 --> 01:23:17.699
I don't have proper lips

1206
01:23:18.206 --> 01:23:19.298
They are fine

1207
01:23:19.574 --> 01:23:21.508
No one's going to kiss me,
what's the point?

1208
01:23:21.576 --> 01:23:24.306
She will
Of course she will.

1209
01:23:24.846 --> 01:23:25.972
She will?

1210
01:23:41.496 --> 01:23:43.123
Then what are you waiting for?

1211
01:23:48.570 --> 01:23:50.003
This network...

1212
01:23:55.377 --> 01:23:56.275
See. He held her hand.

1213
01:23:56.378 --> 01:23:58.346
Didn't I tell you
he held her hand?

1214
01:23:58.980 --> 01:24:00.914
What are you doing,
Chaudhary sir?

1215
01:24:01.583 --> 01:24:03.642
