1216
01:24:03.985 --> 01:24:06.249
It's so crowded.
And the kind of people...

1217
01:24:08.023 --> 01:24:09.684
Please hold on to her.

1218
01:24:10.325 --> 01:24:11.724
We couldn't find anyone here,
brother.

1219
01:24:11.960 --> 01:24:16.222
She isn't here As far
as I know Rakesh...

1220
01:24:16.465 --> 01:24:18.524
...he may have gone to
the court to get married.

1221
01:24:18.800 --> 01:24:19.926
Let's check there

1222
