You two wait here,
I'll make arrangements inside.

1228
01:25:10.685 --> 01:25:12.084
Sit. Sit.

1229
01:25:12.587 --> 01:25:13.918
Be comfortable, sister

1230
01:25:14.089 --> 01:25:15.784
We're comfortable, brother

1231
01:25:24.633 --> 01:25:25.861
Why are you crying?

1232
01:25:25.967 --> 01:25:28.629
Soon we'll be together forever

1233
01:25:28.837 --> 01:25:31.601
The judge's asking
where are the parents?

1234
01:25:31.807 --> 01:25:34.241
Tell him... her father's
busy looking for us.

1235
01:25:35.944 --> 01:25:39.545
Don't cry Don't cry Excuse me

1236
01:25:40.515 --> 01:25:41.504
Why is she crying?

1237
01:25:41.616 --> 01:25:43.243
She's missing her father

1238
01:25:43.885 --> 01:25:45.409
She has a cheap father

1239
