Now let him search.

1251
01:26:13.782 --> 01:26:15.841
Won't your father be worried?

1252
01:26:15.951 --> 01:26:17.111
He will. For few days.

1253
01:26:17.185 --> 01:26:20.985
He'll look for us. Go to
the police station. But what then...

1254
01:26:21.089 --> 01:26:23.683
We'll already be off
to Manali for our honeymoon.

1255
01:26:26.328 --> 01:26:29.161
Don't worry He'll come
back to me begging

1256
01:26:29.231 --> 01:26:31.290
He'll say "Son-in-law,
let's go home"

1257
01:26:31.566 --> 01:26:33.693
Where do you get the courage?

1258
01:26:34.135 --> 01:26:36.701
From friends Best friends

1259
01:26:37.005 --> 01:26:38.370
Love you buddy

1260
01:26:40.041 --> 01:26:41.167
Haven't you heard that saying...

1261
01:26:41.243 --> 01:26:42.733
"Love can't be controlled..."

1262
01:26:43.478 --> 01:26:44.536
You must have, it's a famous one

1263
01:26:44.646 --> 01:26:47.240
By the way, what do you think?

1264
01:26:47.883 --> 01:26:49.475
The lady sitting next to you...

1265
01:26:49.551 --> 01:26:50.711
...will never fall in love

1266
01:26:51.987 --> 01:26:56.253
Tell me sister, will you
stay all your life with this man!

1267
01:26:56.358 --> 01:26:58.758
I mean with your father!

1268
01:26:59.160 --> 01:27:00.889
Listen, her relatives
are looking for her

1269
01:27:00.962 --> 01:27:02.623
Damn these relatives

1270
01:27:03.265 --> 01:27:05.130
That's their nature

1271
01:27:05.433 --> 01:27:07.162
Looking for them
means squandering money

1272
01:27:07.402 --> 01:27:10.371
Pepsi's, snacks... having fun

1273
01:27:10.639 --> 01:27:13.301
Am I right, mister?

1274
01:27:15.210 --> 01:27:16.905
Rascal...

1275
01:27:18.146 --> 01:27:19.613
You think you can
substitute marriage...

1276
01:27:19.681 --> 01:27:21.376
...by getting married in the court?

1277
01:27:21.783 --> 01:27:23.546
Don't you have a soul?

1278
01:27:24.185 --> 01:27:25.482
You eloped with the girl

1279
01:27:25.554 --> 01:27:27.613
Didn't you think about her parents?

1280
01:27:27.789 --> 01:27:28.721
And you?

1281
01:27:29.090 --> 01:27:30.682
Do you like hurting your parents?

1282
01:27:30.892 --> 01:27:32.359
You should be ashamed.

1283
01:27:32.761 --> 01:27:34.194
- And you
- Brother...

1284
01:27:35.864 --> 01:27:37.354
Brother, they aren't inside

1285
01:27:37.866 --> 01:27:39.834
Their application isn't
even in the register

1286
01:27:44.606 --> 01:27:46.938
Don't cry Don't worry.
That man's worried

1287
01:27:47.008 --> 01:27:48.407
I love you, nothing will happen

1288
01:28:10.732 --> 01:28:16.637
"My heart's restless..."

1289
01:28:17.038 --> 01:28:22.738
"My heart's restless..."

1290
01:28:27.549 --> 01:28:30.582
Mister Have you seen them?

1291
