No, sir. I haven't seen them.

1292
01:28:53.108 --> 01:28:54.939
Go away or you'll die.

1293
01:28:55.543 --> 01:28:59.945
Listen to me I told
you, we have no future

1294
01:29:00.982 --> 01:29:02.381
Thank God you told me

1295
01:29:02.484 --> 01:29:04.281
I don't like easy jobs anyway

1296
01:29:06.121 --> 01:29:07.645
That's why I made you my wife

1297
01:29:10.225 --> 01:29:11.419
Look

1298
01:29:11.693 --> 01:29:12.887
Marriage form

1299
01:29:13.561 --> 01:29:14.892
I already signed

1300
01:29:15.296 --> 01:29:16.888
50% marriage is done

1301
01:29:17.399 --> 01:29:19.060
Now we need just your signatures

1302
01:29:19.334 --> 01:29:20.358
What?

1303
01:29:24.506 --> 01:29:27.737
Chaudhary sir, Renu is in that van

1304
01:29:39.421 --> 01:29:44.484
Hey stop, you Idiot

1305
