Come out

1307
01:30:00.742 --> 01:30:03.070
Come out everyone Come on

1308
01:30:03.478 --> 01:30:06.075
You too, come out Keep moving.
Keep moving.

1309
01:30:08.249 --> 01:30:09.773
Come on, get down

1310
01:30:10.652 --> 01:30:14.881
You too, out You... Come on

1311
01:30:14.956 --> 01:30:16.924
- Renu!
- Didn't you hear me?

1312
01:30:17.125 --> 01:30:18.752
- Get down
- Renu!

1313
