Dimpy! Dimpy!

1320
01:31:16.451 --> 01:31:18.351
There was a girl sitting here.
Did you see her?

1321
01:31:18.419 --> 01:31:19.477
No

1322
01:31:19.888 --> 01:31:22.755
Mister. My daughter was sitting
right here. Did you see her?

1323
01:31:22.824 --> 01:31:24.451
She was dressed in blue...

1324
01:31:24.726 --> 01:31:26.216
- Dimpy!
- Look there

1325
01:31:26.294 --> 01:31:28.125
Chaudhary sir.
It's your mistake.

1326
01:31:28.429 --> 01:31:31.159
Why did you bring her along? Now
you've lost both your daughters.

1327
01:31:37.172 --> 01:31:39.800
NO, leave me, help

1328
01:31:43.978 --> 01:31:47.072
Move, what are you doing?

1329
01:31:51.152 --> 01:31:55.646
No, No, No...

1330
01:31:57.492 --> 01:32:00.757
Help, leave my hand

1331
01:32:04.666 --> 01:32:06.691
Save me, help

1332
01:32:09.437 --> 01:32:11.405
Leave me, help

1333
01:32:14.008 --> 01:32:20.379
Oh Almighty lord!

1334
01:32:23.718 --> 01:32:25.743
Let me go, help

1335
01:32:34.729 --> 01:32:36.663
Let me go

1336
01:32:37.398 --> 01:32:40.629
Save me, no

1337
01:32:41.402 --> 01:32:43.962
Leave my hand, leave my hand

1338
01:32:44.072 --> 01:32:47.007
Leave me, no... no

1339
01:32:48.109 --> 01:32:49.599
Hey, move on

1340
01:32:51.746 --> 01:32:53.008
It's a small word

1341
01:32:54.582 --> 01:32:55.742
'Nahi' in Hindi

1342
01:32:56.551 --> 01:32:57.745
'No' in English

1343
01:33:00.722 --> 01:33:01.882
And 'NO' means 'NO'.

1344
01:34:06.087 --> 01:34:07.145
Bablu...

1345
01:34:26.741 --> 01:34:32.611
"My heart's restless..."

1346
01:34:33.047 --> 01:34:38.713
"My heart's restless..."

1347
01:35:02.877 --> 01:35:05.243
Dimpi

1348
01:35:05.813 --> 01:35:08.412
Search there Papa...

1349
01:35:19.727 --> 01:35:22.218
How dare you touch her!

1350
01:35:23.197 --> 01:35:24.687
